WEBVTT

00:00.770 --> 00:06.000
Aoi sora miageru yoko-gao

00:06.000 --> 00:12.080
Tomatta toki no rasen

00:12.080 --> 00:18.650
ltsudemo ijippari de kimochi kakushite iru

00:18.650 --> 00:25.120
Setsunakute (koishikute)
Kurushiku naru

00:25.120 --> 00:28.890
Sonna ni tsuyokunai hazu

00:28.890 --> 00:36.300
Hontou wa futari no
kyori ni okubyou ni naru

00:36.300 --> 00:42.410
Sawatte hoshii no mai haato

00:42.410 --> 00:48.110
Toumawari shitemo tadoritsukeru no nara

00:48.110 --> 00:50.020
Sutaato rain

00:50.020 --> 00:54.590
Kokoro himotoku sutourii

00:54.590 --> 01:00.630
Namida ni sayonara shite
mirai o aruite yukou

01:00.630 --> 01:08.430
Mitsuketa yasashisa mune ni
daite yukeru kara

01:08.430 --> 01:15.270
Onegai ima dake wa sono mama de ite

01:27.720 --> 01:29.950
"Suzuka"

01:31.890 --> 01:33.690
How about the corner?

01:33.690 --> 01:35.660
I know!

01:37.200 --> 01:41.400
And there's no more fuel. Did you fill up?

01:41.400 --> 01:43.230
I'm going to do it right now!

01:43.230 --> 01:45.340
Do a good job, Yamato.

01:45.340 --> 01:47.540
Don't worry.

01:47.540 --> 01:49.340
Well, hang in there.

01:52.440 --> 01:56.580
But... how am I supposed
to work hard for free?

01:56.580 --> 02:01.180
I didn't think Ayano would charge me
the cost of repairing the door.

02:06.760 --> 02:10.260
Man... It's taking forever to finish this.

02:10.260 --> 02:16.060
Asahina, this was your fault,
so you should help me.

02:24.410 --> 02:30.110
"Smile"

02:31.120 --> 02:33.180
Boy, I'm tired...

02:33.180 --> 02:36.120
- Huh?
- Yo! Long time no see.

02:36.120 --> 02:39.620
Ya-Yasunobu! What are doing in my room?

02:39.620 --> 02:42.930
The door wasn't locked.
You should be careful.

02:42.930 --> 02:45.700
Just because the door is unlocked
doesn't mean you can come in!

02:45.700 --> 02:47.970
You even ate my snack!

02:47.970 --> 02:51.900
Come on, don't be so hard on me.
We're best friends, aren't we?

02:51.900 --> 02:54.770
Who said that...

02:54.770 --> 02:59.180
Yasunobu Hatori... He was born
in this town and is the same age as me.

02:59.180 --> 03:01.780
A ladies man, he likes girls
more than he likes to eat...

03:01.780 --> 03:03.610
Hey, do you have any dirty magazines?

03:03.610 --> 03:04.920
No way! Give me a break!

03:04.920 --> 03:06.650
Yeah right.

03:07.490 --> 03:10.050
When I first met him...

03:10.050 --> 03:15.360
it was my first trip to see
Aunt Ayano and I got lost...

03:15.360 --> 03:17.700
What's wrong with you?

03:17.700 --> 03:19.760
Huh?

03:19.760 --> 03:21.700
Look at your ugly face!

03:21.700 --> 03:23.700
What a runny nose!

03:23.700 --> 03:25.030
Who... are you?

03:27.410 --> 03:28.670
Here's a tissue.

03:28.670 --> 03:31.080
Oh thanks...

03:31.080 --> 03:32.840
At first, I thought
he was a nice guy, but...

03:32.840 --> 03:33.540
"Asahiyu"
At first, I thought
he was a nice guy, but...

03:33.540 --> 03:37.010
"Asahiyu"
Hmm, you're a relative
of the public bath owner.

03:37.010 --> 03:37.820
"Asahiyu"
Yeah...

03:37.820 --> 03:38.420
Yeah...

03:38.420 --> 03:40.420
Then I know how you
can thank me for this...

03:40.420 --> 03:41.890
Huh?

03:41.890 --> 03:44.960
That was the beginning
of my misfortune...

03:44.960 --> 03:47.830
Every year I came to Tokyo...

03:47.830 --> 03:51.100
Ya-ma-to, let's go play!

03:51.100 --> 03:52.960
He's coming over again...

03:52.960 --> 03:56.900
Take me to the "secret base"
again this year.

03:56.900 --> 03:59.370
Wow, I can see everything! Great!

03:59.370 --> 04:02.710
We shouldn't be doing this, Yasunobu...

04:02.710 --> 04:06.840
I know! We'll do something
different this year!

04:06.840 --> 04:07.780
Huh?

04:09.980 --> 04:12.480
Help! He's picking on me!

04:12.480 --> 04:17.660
I told him not to peek inside the bath,
then he said shut up and punched me!

04:17.660 --> 04:19.460
What?!

04:19.460 --> 04:20.290
You poor thing!

04:20.290 --> 04:24.900
He already knew how to behave
in front of girls, even at that age.

04:24.900 --> 04:26.600
You're a bad boy, Yamato!

04:26.600 --> 04:28.600
You've got it wrong!

04:28.600 --> 04:31.260
I've always had such bad luck...

04:33.140 --> 04:36.440
You still don't have a girlfriend, do you?

04:36.440 --> 04:38.740
You're kind of a nerd...

04:38.740 --> 04:40.180
Leave me alone.

04:40.180 --> 04:43.550
Well, let's keep being good friends.
We'll go to the same school.

04:43.550 --> 04:44.620
What?

04:44.620 --> 04:47.520
I've heard a lot about you from Miho.

04:47.520 --> 04:50.820
You didn't do anything to Miho, did you?

04:50.820 --> 04:54.960
Don't get me wrong.
I'm not interested in kids.

04:54.960 --> 04:58.100
I like an older,
more mature woman with pheromone.

04:58.100 --> 05:02.770
Your aunt, Ayano, for instance,
is very attractive to me.

05:02.770 --> 05:06.500
I don't care about your taste in women.

05:06.500 --> 05:07.470
Get out of here!

05:07.470 --> 05:09.770
Hey, can't you treat me a little better?

05:09.770 --> 05:10.570
Huh?

05:10.570 --> 05:13.630
"Suzuka Asahina"

05:13.980 --> 05:17.050
Suzuka... It's a sweet name.

05:17.050 --> 05:18.750
What does she look like? Is she cute?

05:18.750 --> 05:22.550
Umm... Asahina?
She's a fifty-something old woman.

05:22.550 --> 05:23.950
Really?

05:23.950 --> 05:27.530
And she's fat and ugly,
and old and has a bad mouth...

05:27.530 --> 05:28.890
Sorry...

05:28.890 --> 05:29.950
Whoa!

05:32.260 --> 05:35.300
...for being fat and ugly,
and old with a bad mouth...

05:35.300 --> 05:37.200
A-Asahina...

05:41.310 --> 05:43.910
You creep!

05:43.910 --> 05:45.500
Darn it...

05:46.610 --> 05:48.410
Hmm...

05:51.780 --> 05:54.050
Asahina, pass me the soy sauce.

05:57.250 --> 06:00.350
Miss Suzuka Asahina...
Please, the soy sauce...

06:02.060 --> 06:03.360
Thank you...

06:03.360 --> 06:04.530
What's going on?

06:04.530 --> 06:08.870
I'm just a fat, ugly old woman
with a bad mouth!

06:08.870 --> 06:10.530
Well, that was...

06:10.530 --> 06:12.140
What's all this about?

06:12.140 --> 06:13.840
Well... Umm...

06:13.840 --> 06:17.170
Yasunobu of the Hatori family
came to visit you today, right?

06:17.170 --> 06:19.710
He stopped by and said hello to me.

06:19.710 --> 06:22.150
He's a well-mannered, cute boy.

06:22.150 --> 06:25.250
Humph! He's just a ladies man!

06:25.250 --> 06:28.450
Well, we went to the same school.

06:28.450 --> 06:31.720
He was very popular with girls,
he even had a fan club.

06:31.720 --> 06:35.360
Really... he's nothing like Yamato.

06:35.360 --> 06:38.100
How do you know? You don't
know anything about me.

06:38.100 --> 06:40.330
I can easily guess.

06:40.330 --> 06:41.820
Did something happen between you guys?

06:43.130 --> 06:44.200
By the way...

06:44.200 --> 06:48.210
You two start school the day
after tomorrow. Let's celebrate.

06:48.210 --> 06:49.440
Celebrate?

06:49.440 --> 06:52.380
Yes, for moving in
and starting high school.

06:52.380 --> 06:54.150
I'll make something good.

06:54.150 --> 06:56.080
Really? Sounds great!

06:56.080 --> 06:58.050
But it's a lot of work.

06:58.050 --> 07:01.050
Don't worry. I like parties a lot.

07:01.050 --> 07:05.960
But I'll be busy tomorrow...
Can you two go shopping?

07:05.960 --> 07:08.720
- What?
- You mean... the two of us?

07:09.990 --> 07:12.100
Please!

07:12.100 --> 07:14.220
All right...

07:18.970 --> 07:20.440
Hey, Yamato!

07:20.440 --> 07:23.370
What are you doing? Hurry up!

07:23.370 --> 07:26.010
Morning...

07:26.010 --> 07:27.450
Did you just wake up?

07:27.450 --> 07:29.210
Umm...

07:30.410 --> 07:32.980
Put your pants on, at least!

07:32.980 --> 07:34.610
Okay.

07:37.990 --> 07:41.230
Stop nagging me so early in the morning.

07:41.230 --> 07:43.930
Because you're so sloppy.

07:43.930 --> 07:45.830
I'm sorry.

07:49.330 --> 07:52.400
Well, not much has changed around here...

07:52.400 --> 07:54.940
See, it's like the old downtown Tokyo.
Do you like it?

07:54.940 --> 07:58.110
I don't know. There're too many people.

07:58.110 --> 08:00.080
I don't like it.

08:00.080 --> 08:01.080
I see...

08:01.080 --> 08:03.680
Let's hurry and finish shopping.

08:03.680 --> 08:06.020
"Household goods"

08:06.020 --> 08:08.850
Huh? A toilet seat cover?

08:08.850 --> 08:11.420
She asked me to get one.

08:11.420 --> 08:14.260
How about this one?

08:14.260 --> 08:16.660
Let's just pick something quickly
and go to the next item.

08:16.660 --> 08:18.760
Wait... we can't do that!

08:18.760 --> 08:19.500
Huh?

08:19.500 --> 08:23.730
Why are you so thoughtless?
Can't you be more considerate?

08:23.730 --> 08:27.640
Just pick anything.
Plus, it's not for you.

08:27.640 --> 08:31.480
No, I can't. We should pick
a good one for our landlady.

08:31.480 --> 08:34.410
Oh, I see.

08:34.410 --> 08:38.280
Shopping with a woman isn't fun...

08:38.280 --> 08:43.650
Especially with her, because she
tries to be perfect all the time.

08:43.650 --> 08:47.590
Picking a toilet seat cover is like this...
I'm anxious about the rest of our day.

08:49.990 --> 08:50.790
I like this!

08:50.790 --> 08:53.230
Oh! It looks great!

08:53.230 --> 08:55.730
You don't sound like you mean it.

08:55.730 --> 08:57.700
Can we go back home by dinner time?

09:00.800 --> 09:04.340
After all, we've walked all over town
for three hours just for shopping.

09:04.340 --> 09:08.280
You're not a perfectionist,
just indecisive.

09:08.280 --> 09:11.020
I want to buy good things.

09:11.020 --> 09:12.980
Yeah, yeah...

09:12.980 --> 09:18.520
Anyway, let's go home now.
I'm not comfortable out here.

09:18.520 --> 09:22.980
Hey, this isn't as bad a place as you think!

09:24.700 --> 09:26.960
I can feel however I want to.

09:26.960 --> 09:31.340
Hey! Why don't we go have lunch?
I know a great place!

09:31.340 --> 09:34.300
I'm sure you'll like this town
if you eat at this place!

09:37.470 --> 09:41.110
Hey, why are we going through here?

09:41.110 --> 09:43.410
This is a shortcut.

09:43.410 --> 09:45.420
I don't like this...

09:45.420 --> 09:48.680
Here we are! This is my favorite store...

09:49.320 --> 09:52.620
"Maison Massage
Pink Angel"

09:52.620 --> 09:55.180
Pink Angel?

09:56.860 --> 10:00.630
Uh-huh, this is your favorite store.

10:00.630 --> 10:02.430
No! It's not!

10:02.430 --> 10:04.700
The lunch place used to be here...

10:04.700 --> 10:05.540
Huh?

10:05.540 --> 10:07.240
What's wrong?

10:07.240 --> 10:11.510
They have the name "Suzuka" here,
but it can't be...

10:11.510 --> 10:13.240
No way!

10:13.240 --> 10:14.810
I'm going home!

10:14.810 --> 10:16.680
Wait! Let's go to another one!

10:16.680 --> 10:17.620
No!

10:17.620 --> 10:19.250
Wait!

10:19.250 --> 10:20.880
Don't follow me!

10:20.880 --> 10:23.220
I promise I'll get it right this time!

10:23.220 --> 10:24.660
Hey, Asahina!

10:24.660 --> 10:25.820
"No cars allowed"

10:26.090 --> 10:27.610
There!

10:31.800 --> 10:33.260
Wow!

10:34.260 --> 10:35.660
Whoa!

10:43.970 --> 10:45.000
Geez...

10:46.480 --> 10:50.310
You're really clumsy and have a big mouth.

10:51.220 --> 10:54.390
We went to a few places
but everything was closed.

10:54.390 --> 10:57.760
You don't know anything
about this town, either.

10:57.760 --> 11:02.460
And why was it closed if it
was a really a good restaurant?

11:02.460 --> 11:03.630
Oh!

11:03.630 --> 11:05.130
What's wrong?

11:05.130 --> 11:06.700
Stay here.

11:06.700 --> 11:08.430
Where are you going?

11:09.430 --> 11:11.230
I'll be right back!

11:17.010 --> 11:19.810
"Shusse Inari"

11:19.810 --> 11:20.640
"Shusse Inari"
A shrine...

11:22.910 --> 11:25.110
So there's a place like this...

11:32.760 --> 11:36.950
It's very quiet and a nice place...
I smell soil...

11:38.200 --> 11:40.460
Thanks for waiting!

11:40.460 --> 11:41.770
Where have you been?

11:41.770 --> 11:44.960
Somewhere... Let's walk up!

11:53.980 --> 11:55.850
Are you praying for success?

11:55.850 --> 11:59.480
Yeah. I heard praying at an
Inari Shrine will bring it to you.

11:59.480 --> 12:00.980
Why don't you pray, too?

12:00.980 --> 12:03.120
Maybe you'll set a record
and will be a great success!

12:03.120 --> 12:05.060
I don't believe in those kinds of things.

12:05.060 --> 12:08.530
You'll be punished
for saying such a thing.

12:08.530 --> 12:12.460
You're religious.
You came here just to pray?

12:12.460 --> 12:13.990
Sort of.

12:15.170 --> 12:16.330
But here.

12:16.330 --> 12:17.800
What's this?

12:17.800 --> 12:19.370
It's a meat and potato croquette.

12:19.370 --> 12:22.610
Only that convenience store has it.

12:22.610 --> 12:26.140
It's a franchise store,
but the store manager adds his choices.

12:26.140 --> 12:30.480
Every time I come to visit Ayano,
I enjoy eating this right here.

12:30.480 --> 12:33.320
And you'll be punished
for eating in a place like this!

12:33.320 --> 12:36.310
Go ahead and eat it. It's really good.

12:37.760 --> 12:40.020
I doubt it.

12:51.540 --> 12:52.770
Yummy!

12:52.770 --> 12:54.240
I told you!

12:54.240 --> 12:59.840
Well, it's because of this atmosphere.
That's why.

12:59.840 --> 13:01.210
Maybe so.

13:02.180 --> 13:05.380
It's good to pray, then eat here.

13:12.460 --> 13:15.660
What kind of wish did you make?

13:15.660 --> 13:18.360
Huh? That I'll have some good luck.

13:18.360 --> 13:22.600
What? That's such a generic wish.

13:22.600 --> 13:24.500
Nothing wrong with it.

13:24.500 --> 13:29.540
Most people don't have
a specific goal like you.

13:29.540 --> 13:33.510
You're really easy-going.
The god of success can't help you...

13:33.510 --> 13:36.480
By the way, you're from Hiroshima, right?

13:36.480 --> 13:38.520
Yeah! It's in the countryside of Hiroshima.

13:38.520 --> 13:40.380
It's known for Hibagon! Check this out!

13:40.380 --> 13:44.420
What brought you to all the way
to Tokyo to go to high school?

13:44.420 --> 13:48.560
Uh, hard to explain,
but a new environment

13:48.560 --> 13:54.800
and starting high school or moving
to a new place makes life exciting...

13:54.800 --> 13:55.770
Maybe...

13:55.770 --> 13:59.300
So I thought coming to Tokyo would
be the most exciting change...

13:59.300 --> 14:03.110
rather than going to a mid-sized town!

14:03.110 --> 14:06.010
- I didn't want to change my life.
- Huh?

14:06.010 --> 14:10.680
I wanted to go to a local school
with the same friends...

14:10.680 --> 14:13.880
and enjoy doing the high jump
like I used to. That's all.

14:13.880 --> 14:16.020
But after all the scouts came,

14:16.020 --> 14:19.820
everybody said I should
go to a good school...

14:19.820 --> 14:21.790
I really didn't want to come.

14:21.790 --> 14:24.030
There're many people
and it's not a good place to live...

14:24.030 --> 14:26.120
and I have a strange neighbor...

14:28.000 --> 14:32.200
But that strange neighbor
has helped my high jump record

14:32.200 --> 14:34.810
and introduced me to a good place.

14:34.810 --> 14:36.440
Huh?

14:36.440 --> 14:38.740
So maybe, just a little...

14:38.740 --> 14:41.270
- I'm starting to like...
- Huh?

14:45.420 --> 14:46.750
This town.

14:46.750 --> 14:48.620
Oh, yeah... this town...

14:48.620 --> 14:52.160
Well, I guess I should thank you.

14:52.160 --> 14:55.460
Uh... thank me...

14:55.460 --> 14:58.760
Let's go back home.
The landlady is waiting for us.

14:58.760 --> 14:59.960
Okay.

14:59.960 --> 15:01.730
Wait for me, Asahina!

15:07.700 --> 15:10.410
Congratulations, Suzuka and Yamato!

15:10.410 --> 15:12.110
Thank you very much.

15:12.110 --> 15:14.480
I'm very embarrassed by this.

15:14.480 --> 15:16.510
Thanks for inviting me, Ayano.

15:16.510 --> 15:18.750
How come you're here?

15:18.750 --> 15:22.790
Why not? He's going to the
same high school, anyway.

15:22.790 --> 15:24.290
Right.

15:24.290 --> 15:26.690
High school student sounds very sweet.

15:26.690 --> 15:29.590
It reminds me of my
innocent teenage days.

15:29.590 --> 15:33.130
Huh? Were you really so innocent?

15:33.130 --> 15:34.560
Of course!

15:34.560 --> 15:36.290
What are you doing here?

15:38.800 --> 15:41.070
We just wanted to say congratulations.

15:41.070 --> 15:43.740
Well, the more people, the better.

15:43.740 --> 15:47.340
I know Saotome is only here
for my mom's food.

15:47.340 --> 15:51.210
It's okay. I made lots of food. Let's eat!

15:51.210 --> 15:52.620
Let's eat.

15:52.620 --> 15:54.850
- Let's eat.
- Let's eat.
- Let's eat.

15:54.850 --> 15:57.190
Here's to you, Goro.

15:57.190 --> 16:01.360
Man, your food is the best, Ayano!

16:01.360 --> 16:04.590
Really? You can come to eat anytime.

16:04.590 --> 16:06.330
Thanks, I will.

16:06.330 --> 16:08.230
Hey, hey...

16:08.230 --> 16:11.270
Shoot, I forgot to bring booze.

16:11.270 --> 16:12.870
Here you go!

16:12.870 --> 16:15.670
Thanks, you think of everything.

16:15.670 --> 16:19.840
I picked one to match
your mellow personality.

16:19.840 --> 16:21.450
What a jerk.

16:21.450 --> 16:24.640
Don't drink too much, Saotome.

16:26.150 --> 16:28.220
You, too, Megumi.

16:28.220 --> 16:32.420
- By the way, aren't you
going to graduate school.
- Yes.

16:32.420 --> 16:37.490
You must be very smart. I'm pretty stupid,
so can you be my tutor sometime?

16:37.490 --> 16:39.260
I'd be happy to...

16:39.260 --> 16:41.370
That sounds good, Megumi.

16:41.370 --> 16:43.570
He had some nice comments about
something other than your breasts.

16:43.570 --> 16:45.570
Stop making fun of me, Saotome.

16:45.570 --> 16:47.090
What's going on here?

16:48.070 --> 16:50.770
Yasunobu makes us laugh...

16:50.770 --> 16:52.810
Humph! He just has a big mouth!

16:52.810 --> 16:55.150
You'd better stop it...

16:55.150 --> 16:56.650
I like cheerful people.

16:56.650 --> 16:57.840
Huh?

17:03.520 --> 17:06.160
Well, it's about time to end the party.

17:06.160 --> 17:07.560
Thanks for the great food.

17:07.560 --> 17:09.830
I don't want to go home yet!
Let's have a post-party party!

17:09.830 --> 17:11.030
Good idea!

17:11.030 --> 17:12.330
How about you, Yamato?

17:12.330 --> 17:15.030
Well, I'll pass.

17:18.900 --> 17:21.770
But why do I have to go with you?

17:21.770 --> 17:25.880
Why not? Yuka wants rice crackers.

17:25.880 --> 17:28.480
You're very diligent,
especially in this kind of situation.

17:28.480 --> 17:30.450
You're too lazy.

17:30.450 --> 17:34.620
I can't believe the things you
say to women just to be popular.

17:34.620 --> 17:38.020
Idiot, I don't speak unless I mean it.

17:38.020 --> 17:41.120
Besides, all women like praise.

17:41.120 --> 17:44.560
Asahina likes it too, huh?

17:44.560 --> 17:48.470
Why don't you learn from me
and compliment her?

17:48.470 --> 17:51.200
I can't do that.

17:51.200 --> 17:54.600
I know you can't.

17:54.600 --> 17:57.040
What?

17:57.040 --> 17:59.940
By the way, Suzuka is very cute.

17:59.940 --> 18:00.780
Huh?

18:00.780 --> 18:03.580
Why did you tell me
she's an ugly old woman?

18:03.580 --> 18:06.380
Is there a reason why you
didn't tell me the truth?

18:06.380 --> 18:08.520
Not really.

18:08.520 --> 18:11.220
Really?

18:11.220 --> 18:14.460
So, I'll try to win her over.

18:14.460 --> 18:18.360
Humph! You can't win her over!

18:18.360 --> 18:19.990
You'll see.

18:21.200 --> 18:23.070
Suzuka!

18:23.070 --> 18:24.860
- Huh?
- Oh?

18:27.840 --> 18:30.710
I thought you went to another party.

18:30.710 --> 18:33.810
Yeah, but we're going to get some snacks.

18:33.810 --> 18:35.650
What are you doing?

18:35.650 --> 18:39.280
I'm running. I didn't get
enough training today.

18:39.280 --> 18:44.250
I see, you're really dedicated.
But it's kind of late for a young girl.

18:44.250 --> 18:45.260
Let me take you home.

18:45.260 --> 18:47.290
- Huh?
- Uh... well...

18:47.290 --> 18:49.190
Don't worry.

18:49.190 --> 18:51.700
Wait! How about a snack?

18:51.700 --> 18:53.130
I'll let you do it.

18:53.130 --> 18:55.400
Huh?

18:55.400 --> 18:57.170
Be more considerate, will you?

18:57.170 --> 18:59.840
Nope! I'll take her home!

18:59.840 --> 19:00.860
Huh?

19:02.070 --> 19:03.310
Let's go, Asahina.

19:03.310 --> 19:05.910
Wait! I'm OK by myself.

19:05.910 --> 19:07.100
Come on!

19:09.450 --> 19:12.970
Good luck, Mr. Shy-Guy Yamato!

19:21.060 --> 19:24.420
Hey! Let go of my arm!

19:25.260 --> 19:27.660
Don't be ridiculous!

19:29.970 --> 19:32.800
Not really...

19:32.800 --> 19:34.840
I know you can't do it.

19:34.840 --> 19:37.360
Yes, I can...

19:38.710 --> 19:40.340
Hey, Asahina!

19:40.340 --> 19:41.410
What?

19:41.410 --> 19:45.280
Uh... You have nice ears!

19:45.280 --> 19:46.620
Huh?

19:46.620 --> 19:50.420
Well, I think your ears
are a very good shape...

19:50.420 --> 19:52.490
Are you crazy?

19:52.490 --> 19:56.990
Hey! I'm giving you a compliment,
but you're not being nice!

19:56.990 --> 20:02.670
Because I'm a fat, ugly,
old woman with a bad mouth.

20:02.670 --> 20:05.870
Are you still holding a grudge
against me? You're so petty.

20:05.870 --> 20:09.740
Someone who speaks ill of others
is even more petty!

20:09.740 --> 20:13.110
I'm sorry!

20:16.680 --> 20:18.770
Damn... This is disgusting.

20:22.590 --> 20:27.660
You're so cool while you do
the high jump, but once you speak...

20:27.660 --> 20:28.920
Huh?

20:30.190 --> 20:32.930
You said cool... You mean me?

20:32.930 --> 20:36.700
Yeah, I was fascinated with you
when I first saw you.

20:39.500 --> 20:42.130
Nobody's told me anything like that...

20:43.570 --> 20:45.210
T-Thank you.

20:45.210 --> 20:47.240
Huh?

20:47.240 --> 20:52.220
Well, but that's because you
haven't seen other jumpers before...

20:52.220 --> 20:56.820
No way! I know what's good and bad!

20:56.820 --> 21:01.390
Really? Because you're always so flippant.

21:01.390 --> 21:07.020
Listen... You'd better believe me!
You were very beautiful! Really!

21:09.470 --> 21:10.800
Yes...

21:10.800 --> 21:12.390
Since then, I...

21:20.740 --> 21:22.580
I...

21:25.120 --> 21:27.650
What?

21:27.650 --> 21:29.980
Nothing.

21:30.820 --> 21:32.090
I'm falling in love with you, but...

21:32.090 --> 21:33.890
but I can't say it...

21:36.460 --> 21:37.790
No way.

21:40.560 --> 21:45.970
Kaze ni naru yo aoi fiirudo de

21:45.970 --> 21:48.770
lma wa tada...

21:48.770 --> 21:55.910
Choppiri "yake" ni
"atsuku" natte supiido agete

21:55.910 --> 21:56.580
lkou

21:56.580 --> 21:57.340
Hashiru

21:57.340 --> 21:57.950
Tomaru

21:57.950 --> 21:58.580
Susumu

21:58.580 --> 21:59.280
Hirumu

21:59.280 --> 21:59.950
Haneru

21:59.950 --> 22:01.920
Shagamu

22:01.920 --> 22:02.550
Utau

22:02.550 --> 22:03.220
Sakebu

22:03.220 --> 22:04.020
Michiru

22:04.020 --> 22:04.520
Kakeru

22:04.520 --> 22:06.690
lkiru koko de

22:06.690 --> 22:12.130
Konna mucha na ikikata mo manzara
waruku wa nai ne

22:12.130 --> 22:17.720
Nanika okiru sonna ki ga shiteru

22:19.470 --> 22:22.400
Aza-darake ni naru hibi ni

22:24.840 --> 22:32.480
"Genkai" o kanjiru hi mo arundakedo ne...

22:32.480 --> 22:37.550
Kaze ni naru yo aoi fiirudo de

22:37.550 --> 22:43.220
Isshun o hashiri-nukete iku

22:43.220 --> 22:48.360
Katachi nante kawatte iku mono dakara

22:48.360 --> 22:51.070
Tomerarenai...

22:51.070 --> 22:54.130
Choppiri "ganko" de "yancha"

22:54.130 --> 22:57.970
"Makezu-girai"

22:57.970 --> 22:58.640
Kokoro

22:58.640 --> 22:59.310
Hashiru

22:59.310 --> 22:59.970
Tomaru

22:59.970 --> 23:00.510
Susumu

23:00.510 --> 23:01.140
Hirumu

23:01.140 --> 23:01.780
Haneru

23:01.780 --> 23:04.010
Shagamu

23:04.010 --> 23:04.510
Utau

23:04.510 --> 23:05.180
Sakebu

23:05.180 --> 23:06.010
Michiru

23:06.010 --> 23:06.710
Kakeru

23:06.710 --> 23:09.880
lkiru koko de

23:10.320 --> 23:14.660
I'm starving. Thank you, Asahina.

23:14.660 --> 23:18.390
Why didn't you tell me that earlier?

23:18.390 --> 23:19.390
What's this?

23:19.390 --> 23:20.690
A honey and lemon drink...

23:21.060 --> 23:21.860
"Next episode: The Visit"

23:21.860 --> 23:23.660
"Next episode: The Visit"
...without lemon.

23:23.660 --> 23:24.890
"Next episode: The Visit"
It's sour!
